{"post_stream": {"posts": [{"id": 318124, "name": "Jerry James", "username": "jjames", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/jjames/{size}/28140_2.png", "created_at": "2024-06-26T16:12:45.913Z", "cooked": "<p>I have orphaned some packages I no longer use.  Many of these supported sagemath.  Since F38 reached EOL, there is no sagemath package in any supported Fedora release.  Most of these packages are on their latest version, have no open bugs, and are not used by any other package in Fedora.  Exceptions are noted below.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/coxeter\">coxeter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/ecl\">ecl</a>: used by <a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/maxima\">maxima</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/eclib\">eclib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/freetdi-gala\">freetdi-gala</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/gmp-ecm\">gmp-ecm</a>: used by <a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/giac\">giac</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/gnofract4d\">gnofract4d</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/jmol\">jmol</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/jni-inchi\">jni-inchi</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/libhomfly\">libhomfly</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/mcqd\">mcqd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/minisat2\">minisat2</a>: used by <a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/cbmc\">cbmc</a> and <a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/link-grammar\">link-grammar</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/ocaml-ppx-import\">ocaml-ppx-import</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/primecount\">primecount</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/python-BTrees\">python-BTrees</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://src.f